<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH JULY CPI 3.5 PCT VS JUNE, 9.4 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>CZECH JULY CPI 3.5 PCT VS JUNE, 9.4 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech July consumer prices rose 3.5 percent, putting year-on-year inflation at 9.4 percent, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Friday.</p>
<p> CZECH CONSUMER INFLATION     July 97   June 97  July 96</p>
<p>  pct change month/month	  +3.5	+1.2     +1.0</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	    +9.4	+6.8     +9.4</p>
</text>
